    "description": "An exciting career opportunity awaits you at iDiscoveri Education Consulting Pvt Ltd. We are on the lookout for a dedicated Curriculum Developer to strengthen our Ghaziabad-based team.\n\nAbout iDiscoveri Education Consulting Pvt Ltd:\niDiscoveri Education Consulting Pvt Ltd is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Coordinate with academic counselors for student career guidance\n• Conduct parent-teacher meetings and update parents on student performance\n• Monitor student progress and provide timely feedback\n• Maintain student records and prepare progress reports\n• Support students with special educational needs\n• Design formative and summative assessments aligned to learning objectives\n• Participate in teacher training and professional development programs\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• MBA from a recognized university\n• 10-15 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Student Assessment\n• Proficiency in Special Education\n• Proficiency in Curriculum Development\n• Proficiency in Communication Skills\n• Proficiency in LMS Platforms\n• Proficiency in Mentoring\n• Proficiency in Lesson Planning\n• Proficiency in Classroom Management\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Annual paid leaves and casual leaves\n• Referral bonus program\n• Life and accident insurance\n• International travel opportunities for senior roles\n• Learning & development budget\n• Annual performance appraisal\n• Salary Range: 20 LPA - 40 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Ghaziabad, Uttar Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with iDiscoveri Education Consulting Pvt Ltd!",
